    "profile_text": {
        "body": "Zebra Technologies Corp. is a public company headquartered in Lincolnshire, Illinois, trading under the ticker ZBRA. Its website describes the company as \"The World's Foundation for Intelligent Operations,\" offering mobile computers, scanners, printers, RFID, and related hardware and software to digitize, automate, and enhance processes. SEC records identify the company by CIK 0000877212.\n\nThe company's site highlights AI software for frontline operations, including Zebra Companion AI, Zebra Frontline AI Enablers, and Zebra Frontline AI Blueprints. It also presents the Zebra Aurora suite of machine vision software and Zebra Aurora Focus for controlling fixed industrial scanners and machine vision smart cameras in manufacturing and logistics automation.\n\nIllinois public records list 375 law exposure entries for Zebra Technologies Corp. The available facts do not list specific products or cases beyond those named above.",
